# Normalise line endings so the repository is identical on Windows and Linux.
#
# The important entry is *.bat: cmd.exe is happiest with CRLF-terminated batch
# files, and `core.autocrlf=input` (used to keep the tree clean) would otherwise
# commit tools/oss.bat with LF endings.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.sh  text eol=lf

# Binary-ish artefacts that must never be line-ending translated.
*.vcd -text
*.json -text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
